429 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (My PhD research explores elevated jet-in-crossflow dynamics, focusing on applications like smoke exhaust and deep-sea sewage disposal. Using advanced visualization and measurement techniques \(LIF, LDV, PIV\), it investigates the jet shear layers, wake structures, and vortex shedding across various geometric and flow parameters. Insights into flow topology and turbulence characteristics aim to optimize stack design and improve pollution dispersion strategies.       )
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
