434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In my work, I have analyzed the flow transition of laminar separation bubble subjected to varying adverse pressure gradient and freestream turbulence using experiments and a well-resolved Large Eddy Simulation \(LES\) using Fluent. Apart from this, I have also studied the boundary layer evolution over bio-inspired textured surfaces \(Herringbone Riblet and Fish Scale array\) that are useful in enhancing the aerodynamic performance of a flying object. In addition to this, I have also developed local and bi-global linear stability solver in Matlab.       )
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
