/T (To develop an efficient numerical technique for fibre-reinforced polymer composites that can capture accurate damage mechanisms under low-velocity impact \(LVI\) within the finite element method framework. This framework is very useful for industries because LVI is a very common event to components of a structure, e.g. Tool drop, Bird strike, Hail impact, etc.       )
